    <string name="clip_info_title">Waɗanne tsari za a yi amfani da su?</string>
    <string name="clip_info_body">Kana buƙatar fayilolin tsari guda biyu (Tsarin Hoto da Tsarin Rubutu) a tsarin ONNX (.onnx). Dole ne duka tsare-tsaren su fitar da girman sakamako ɗaya, kuma tsarin rubutun dole ne ya yarda da alamomin IDs. Tsarin CLIP ViT-B/32 na yau da kullun suna aiki sosai.\n\nTsarin asali da aka yi amfani da su anan sune:\n- vision_model_quantized.onnx don hoto\n- text_model_quantized.onnx don rubutu.\n
        \nYana amfani da tsarin hoto don duba kowane hoto a dakin karatunka sannan ya ƙirƙiri lissafin lissafi (embedding) don shi.
        \nSannan yana amfani da Tsarin Rubutu don fassara kalmar bincikenka zuwa sakamako, kwatanta shi da sakamakon hotonka, sannan ya daidaita bincikenka!
    </string>
